# One line per graded task, append-only, in run order.
# The reporting-chain watch (5-minute cron) greps this file.
# The coordinator's chat message to the parent, if any, is a copy of
# the file line below, not the record itself.
# Format (pipe-delimited, one line per task):
#   TIMESTAMP | TASK_ID | VERDICT | PAIR | TIEBREAKER | INVALID_OR_BACKUP | ELAPSED
# TIMESTAMP: ISO 8601 with timezone, time the report line was written.
# TASK_ID: R3-xxx, or DP-0x when a backup replaces a task.
# VERDICT: PASS, FAIL, or INVALID.
# PAIR: A (positions 1-28) or B (positions 29-55).
# TIEBREAKER: tiebreaker session short id if one was invoked, else "-".
# INVALID_OR_BACKUP: "INVALID:<reason> -> <backup>" when invalid,
#   or "BACKUP:<backup>" when a backup ran, else "-".
# ELAPSED: task wall time, e.g. 14m22s (from task start to graded).
